@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health (open for everyone)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Health with details (logged in)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice

### Liveness and readiness (for the platform)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Which metrics are there?
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice

### Our own counter
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/bookings.confirmed
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice

### Requests to the booking endpoint (the braces of {eventId} as %7B and %7D, or Tomcat answers 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/metrics/http.server.requests?tag=uri:/api/events/%7BeventId%7D/bookings
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice

### Book with our own request id
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/1/bookings
Authorization: Basic alice@example.com alice
X-Request-Id: call-from-alice-1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "seats": 2 }
